01:11:30.240 --> 01:11:32.550
Summations are
actually accurate.

01:11:32.550 --> 01:11:35.280
Integration is approximation.

01:11:35.280 --> 01:11:35.988
It's a reverse.

01:11:35.988 --> 01:11:37.530
So typically, when
we do integration,

01:11:37.530 --> 01:11:39.270
